{"unit_id":"schrolemons__chat-harness-7-2-lays-for-a-AI-bot#card-zh","repo":"schrolemons/chat-harness-7-2-lays-for-a-AI-bot","commit":"1fe79d8d0b5a6bb74faea9e53dab86f9049044f5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Chat Bridge 是一款面向 DSH 的 QQ 聊天桥接插件，通过独立实例控制器连接 DSH 会话与 SnowLuma/OneBot，让机器人能够处理 QQ 私聊和群聊。它在 DSH 中提供实例启动栏和设置面板，可查看连接状态、启动或停止服务，并编辑机器人 QQ、白名单及端口。桥接把 QQ 收到的消息交给 DSH 会话处理，再通过工具将回复发回 QQ；实例控制器负责装载运行时和配套能力。适合希望把 DSH Agent 接入 QQ、并从 DSH 界面管理桥接实例的用户。使用前需要配置 QQ 机器人账号和 SnowLuma 连接凭据，并准备 Node.js 24 或更新版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:1-24","dsh-entry.mjs:1-44","src/dsh-instance-controller.mjs:86-144","plugins/qq-launcher/lib/index.js:1-36","dsh-client.js:7-10","src/bridge.js:27-30"]}
{"unit_id":"schrolemons__chat-harness-7-2-lays-for-a-AI-bot#card-en","repo":"schrolemons/chat-harness-7-2-lays-for-a-AI-bot","commit":"1fe79d8d0b5a6bb74faea9e53dab86f9049044f5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Chat Bridge connects DSH with QQ chats through SnowLuma/OneBot. Its launcher shows status, starts or stops the bridge, and edits QQ bot settings and ports. DSH handles incoming messages and sends replies to QQ. Setup needs a QQ bot account, SnowLuma credentials, and Node.js 24+.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:1-24","dsh-entry.mjs:1-44","src/dsh-instance-controller.mjs:86-144","plugins/qq-launcher/lib/index.js:1-36","dsh-client.js:7-10","src/bridge.js:27-30"]}
